OL,3,GNEWSAFormer president of Athletics NI
OL,4,Apleads guilty to child sex abuse charge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former president of Athletics
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland has been put on the
OL,8,Fsex offenders register after pleading
OL,9,Fguilty to a child sex offence at
OL,10,FBelfast Crown Court.
OL,12,FGerry Carson, 84, from Kingsway,
OL,13,FDunmurry in County Antrim, changed his
OL,14,Fplea on Thursday morning.
OL,16,FCarson had previously pleaded not
OL,17,Fguilty to the charge of sexual touching
OL,18,Fof a child.
OL,20,FAt a previous hearing in October,
OL,21,FCarson pleaded guilty to two charges of
OL,22,Fstalking.
